<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI 9-mth net up 69 percent.</title>
<headline>BPI 9-mth net up 69 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of the Philippine Islands posted a 69 percent increase in net income in the first nine months of the year to 2.47 billion pesos, parent firm Ayala Corp said in a statement on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Ayala senior managing director Mercedita Nolledo told the Philippine Securities and Exchange Commission the bank's net income from January to September represented a return on average equity of 21.56 percent.</p>
<p>The bank merged with Citytrust Banking Corp early this month.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
